{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work-list", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"facets": {}, "total-results": 3334827, "items": [{"DOI": "10.1111/apel.12149", "title": ["From share issue privatisation to non-tradable share reform: a review of privatisation in China"], "author": [{"given": "Feng", "family": "Xie", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [{"name": "School of Economics and Finance; Massey University; New Zealand"}], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "Jing", "family": "Chi", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [{"name": "School of Economics and Finance; Massey University; New Zealand"}], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "Jing", "family": "Liao", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [{"name": "School of Economics and Finance; Massey University; New Zealand"}], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2016, 11]]}, "container-title": ["Asian-Pacific Economic Literature"], "publisher": "Wiley", "is-referenced-by-count": 2, "type": "journal-article"}, {"DOI": "10.1787/888933000153", "title": ["Figure 2.5. Cumulated privatisation revenues as a share of GDP"], "issued": {"date-parts": [[null]]}, "publisher": "Organisation for Economic Co-Operation and Development  (OECD)", "is-referenced-by-count": 2, "type": "component"}, {"publisher": "Universidade Federal de Santa Catarina (UFSC)", "abstract": "<jats:p>Este artículo expone el mecanismo de la golden share, invento británico llevado a cabo con la función de servir de instrumento de control estatal en las empresas privatizadas a partir de la década de ochenta del siglo pasado, emulado por los demás países europeos con diversa denominación y similar finalidad. Presenta la jurisprudencia del Tribunal de Justicia de la Unión Europea en la materia, que le ha llevadoa anular varios preceptos legales de Estados miembros que vulneraban, a través de tales restricciones, el principio de libre circulación de capitales y de libertad de establecimiento. Analiza, por fin, la adaptación del mecanismo a la legislación brasileña bajo el título de ação de classe especial, su previsión en los estatutos de concretas empresas privatizadas y el reciente protagonismo que tales instrumentos han tenido en los últimos años, ocasionando el temor a la reestatización por parte de los inversores.</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.5007/2177-7055.2010v31n60p75", "type": "journal-article", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["La golden share como instrumento de control estatal en empresas privatizadas", "The golden share as state control instrument in privatized companies"], "author": [{"given": "Helga Maria Saboia", "family": "Bezerra", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "container-title": ["Seqüência Estudos Jurídicos e Políticos"], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2010, 11, 18]]}}, {"DOI": "10.4324/9780429199738-15", "title": ["The UK Privatisation Model: Is it Transferable to Developing Countries?"], "author": [{"given": "Colin", "family": "Kirkpatrick", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2019, 2, 11]]}, "container-title": ["Privatisation in the UK"], "publisher": "Routledge", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "type": "book-chapter"}, {"DOI": "10.4324/9780429199738-4", "title": ["Privatisation and the Consumer"], "author": [{"given": "John", "family": "Hatch", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2019, 2, 11]]}, "container-title": ["Privatisation in the UK"], "publisher": "Routledge", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "type": "book-chapter"}, {"DOI": "10.4324/9780429199738-13", "title": ["Privatisation in the Water Sector"], "author": [{"given": "W.R.", "family": "Harper", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]